# Git Branch Policy

- Work on the `Jawad` branch for this project.
- Before making changes, verify the current branch is `Jawad` (`git checkout Jawad` if not).

# Deploy Policy (Railway)

Production site: https://aihackaton-production-f0c0.up.railway.app/

- After every logical change, **commit and push to `origin/Jawad`** so Railway redeploys.
- Do not wait for the user to ask — commit and push once a unit of work is done.
- Use clear commit messages describing what changed and why.
- Stage relevant changed files with `git add`, then `git commit`, then `git push origin Jawad`.
- Never commit `.env` or other secret files.
